{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1447810-knacks-slots-by-calling-dots","id":1447810,"title":"Knacks slots by calling dots?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-07T07:05:52-07:00","id":1447810,"title":"Knacks slots by calling dots?","content":"Hello guys!<br /> <br /> I need some help to understand the mechanics behind \u201cactive knacks slots\u201d,when a player have trickster 3 dots guardian 2 dots and sage 1 dots, that means their can have 6 knacks slots? Or that mean their have 3 knacks slots just for trickster knacks, 2 slots just for guardian knacks and 1 slot for sage knack?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-07T07:17:06-07:00","id":1447811,"title":"","content":"The latter.<br /> <br /> 3 dots in Trickster means that you get Knacks only for that Calling and can use either three Heroic Knacks or 1 Immortal and 1 Heroic Knack per session.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T16:03:01-07:00","id":1448172,"title":"","content":"I got it, thanks for the answer man, it make a lot more sense now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5311-thiagocord","name":"Thiagocord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T20:09:11-07:00","id":1448191,"title":"","content":"You can break that rule a bit if you have a Guide that teaches another Calling - and use your knack slots for Knacks for that Calling without having to actually have the Calling as one of your three.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-10-2021, 11:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T20:54:23-07:00","id":1448193,"title":"","content":"So just being sure. Ignoring the guide or relic scenario, the above case of 3, 2,1 would allow 3 trickster slots, 2 guard slots, and a sage slot?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T23:14:11-07:00","id":1448201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1447810-knacks-slots-by-calling-dots?p=1448193#post1448193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So just being sure. Ignoring the guide or relic scenario, the above case of 3, 2,1 would allow 3 trickster slots, 2 guard slots, and a sage slot?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. And remember that characters start with 5 Calling dots at Hero level, so the possible combinations from the start would be:<br /> <br /> 3, 1, 1<br /> or<br /> 2, 2, 1","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-11T13:13:46-07:00","id":1448258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1447810-knacks-slots-by-calling-dots?p=1448193#post1448193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So just being sure. Ignoring the guide or relic scenario, the above case of 3, 2,1 would allow 3 trickster slots, 2 guard slots, and a sage slot?</div> </div> </div> </div>Relic knacks, as opposed to almost all other knacks provided by Birthrights, don't normally eat up 'Knack slots'.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}